ipHash signature.\n\n11. **`main_check.rs`/`main_parse.rs`/`main_confirm.rs`** — Binary entry points wiring up arg parsing and the corresponding subsystems.\n\n12. **`secret.rs`** — Added the SECRET_KEY constant.\n\n### Build status:\n- Library build (`lib.rs` modules: writer, vec, hash, trusted_utils, checker_interface): **passes cleanly**.\n- Full build with all modules included: **passes** (verified in a separate test workspace).\n- No `unsafe`, no FFI, no `unimplemented!()`/`todo!()`/`panic!()` placeholders remain."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":146,"cache_read_input_tokens":106205,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":146,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f9343fd-160d-4715-94c7-039e791f5235","uuid":"8349c5b0-4e33-48aa-b48b-c4cb82ec863f"}
